    // Original streams listing is tricky: site_test with 1 post (no stream) had streams ["/streams.html"] (non-empty). Our logic above for tags/authors would give empty when no streams. But site_test shows non-empty. So streams.html is listed even when no stream content, if there are posts? Let's check: gen/out with 0 posts had streams [] (empty). So streams.html listed when posts non-empty, even if no stream content.
